title: "HackMatch — US-024: Locked Team Manifest Export Sequence"
---
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"background":"#ffffff","primaryColor":"#e8f1ff","primaryTextColor":"#1f2937","primaryBorderColor":"#3b82f6","lineColor":"#4b5563","secondaryColor":"#f1e8ff","tertiaryColor":"#fff7d6","fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif"},"sequence":{"useMaxWidth":true,"diagramMarginX":25,"diagramMarginY":18,"actorMargin":34,"width":165,"height":60,"boxMargin":8,"messageMargin":24,"noteMargin":10}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Member as Confirmed team member
    participant UI as TeamManifestCard
    participant API as Team manifest API
    participant Service as Manifest service
    participant Repos as Team and profile repositories
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Member->>UI: Open locked-team manifest
    UI->>API: GET /api/teams/:teamId/manifest
    API->>API: Require active verified PART
    API->>Service: Export requested format
    Service->>Repos: Load team, memberships, event, profiles
    Repos->>DB: Query current records
    DB-->>Repos: Locked team and confirmed roster
    Repos-->>Service: Domain records
    Service->>Service: Confirm membership and locked state
    Service->>Service: Project safe fields and pseudonyms
    Service->>Service: Canonicalize and compute SHA-256
    Service->>Repos: Save manifest snapshot
    Repos->>DB: Record latest and deduplicated snapshot
    DB-->>Repos: Stored manifest metadata
    Repos-->>Service: Persisted snapshot result
    Service-->>API: JSON, printable HTML, or PDF
    API-->>UI: Attachment or safe manifest view
    UI-->>Member: Roster, UTC lock time, checksum

    alt Access or state denied
        Service-->>API: Safe not-found or forbidden error
        API-->>UI: No roster data
        UI-->>Member: Error and retry state
    end

    Note over Service,UI: Event data is stored record context.<br/>The export does not claim organizer acceptance or legal eligibility.

